      "created_at": "2013-04-10T21:46:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, I wanted to know what you guys think would work better:</p><p>A comedy/drama about Tachyon and Unity which takes place when they start working together,</p><p>or...</p><p>A drama about a 13-year-old Visionary who reads strangers' minds, and attempts to befriend someone she hears having depressing/suicidal thoughts.</p><p>Any input on this? I've got to shoot for 12-15 page script, so keep that in mind. Which would make a better short film, do you all think?</p><p>Not that I'm actually using this script to be produced, of course. Just for the assignment.</p>",
