      "created_at": "2013-04-11T00:12:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Based on the information given, I would go with the Visionary storyline. A 12-15 page script is kind of short, and with short stories you really need to have your beginning, middle, and end mapped out at least a little bit before writing, and it seems like you have more of an idea of what the&nbsp;conflict and resolution&nbsp;is with the Visionary story. I'm sure the Tachy, Unity story would be a lot of fun, but it seems like right now you're hoping that the premise itself will give you an interesting story as you're writing it.</p>",
