      "created_at": "2013-04-11T03:23:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don't know how much your teacher would actually care about this, but a Visionary movie would also be much easier to make. As long as you're not having shoot lasers out of her head, most psychic powers are pretty easy to have effects for. Doing Tachyon and Unity justice would require money and talented prop artists.</p>",
