      "created_at": "2013-04-13T05:45:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Oh, an older version of the Dreamer, that does change a lot about the story.</p><p>As for dialogue heavy with Tachyon and Unity, not neccessarily. They both strike me as work-aholics, who get very into their work. Maybe tell the story through e-mails or something in-between their projects were they are being less chatty then on their time off... of course, this is a script not a short story which makes that harder... I'm in a short story class so that's how my brain is calibrated at the moment</p>",
